# Archive of the runs behind ../README.md, copied from Miyabi-G
# (~/work/determinism) before the machine was decommissioned.
#
# Tracked here: the run definitions, the job scripts, the PBS/stdout logs,
# the comparison results, and the exact analysis scripts that produced them
# -- everything needed to read what was done and what came out.
#
# Not tracked: rms.dat and cfl.dat.  They are kept in this directory (and so
# are backed up by Dropbox) but they are bulk time series, not evidence, and
# they do not belong in the repository.  The field data the comparison
# actually operates on (restart/*.dat, ~100 MB per run) was deliberately not
# copied from Miyabi; the verdicts it produced live in compare_all_fixed.out,
# probe_all_fixed.out and rmhd/compare_rmhd.out.
#
# The comparison results are re-included by name, not as *.out, so that
# <code>.modes.out -- a 3 MB per-step mode dump that no script here reads --
# cannot be pulled back in by the pattern.
*
!*/
__pycache__/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.in
!job.pbs-*
!out.std
!compare_*.out
!probe_*.out
!*.o[0-9]*
!*.py
!*.sh
